</script>
</div><div class="ptl_portlet_vertical"><div class="ptl_top_portlet" style="display:none;"></div><div id="ctl00_ContentPlaceHolder1_ctl38_divContent"><h2 style="margin-top: 50px;">Which Employee Groups Will Receive Funds?</h2></div>
</div><div class="ptl_portlet_vertical"><div class="ptl_top_portlet" style="display:none;"></div><div id="ctl00_ContentPlaceHolder1_ctl41_divContent"><p>The retention and recruitment funds are intended for school-based and school-related employees, including:</p>
<ul>
    <li>Teachers (includes Pre-K and technical college staff)</li>
    <li>Paraprofessionals</li>
    <li>Bus drivers &amp; transportation staff</li>
    <li>ESE support staff</li>
    <li>Counselors, social workers, and psychologists</li>
    <li>School safety personnel</li>
    <li>Custodial, cafeteria, and clerical staff</li>
    <li>Facilities and maintenance staff</li>
    <li>School administrators</li>
</ul>
<p>It is important to note that the retention and recruitment funds are not limited to classroom teachers. The funding is also intended for various other positions that help schools operate every single day.</p></div>
</div><div class="ptl_portlet_vertical"><div class="ptl_top_portlet" style="display:none;"></div><div id="ctl00_ContentPlaceHolder1_ctl44_divContent"><h2 style="margin-top: 50px; margin-bottom: 0px;">Recruitment and Retention Allocation</h2></div>
</div><div class="ptl_portlet_vertical"><div class="ptl_top_portlet" style="display:none;"></div><div id="ctl00_ContentPlaceHolder1_ctl47_divContent"><ul>
    <li>Under Florida's Public Employees Relations Act (PERA), school boards must bargain in good faith with certified unions (like the teacher's union or support personnel unions) for any new revenue, such as that generated from a voter-approved tax referendum, if it is intended to affect staff pay or benefits.</li>
    <li>Even if the referendum language states that a portion of the funds will be used for salaries, implementation still requires bargaining regarding the amounts (varies in many instances based upon years of service or position), distribution method, eligibility, and structure (e.g., flat supplement, percentage raise, performance-based bonus).</li>
    <li>Negotiations would seek to address:
    <ul>
        <li>Whether all employees get the same amount or if it is tiered</li>
        <li>Whether the funds go into base salary or are a recurring supplement</li>
        <li>Timelines for disbursements</li>
    </ul>
    </li>
</ul></div>
</div><div class="ptl_portlet_vertical"><div class="ptl_top_portlet" style="display:none;"></div><div id="ctl00_ContentPlaceHolder1_ctl50_divContent"><h2 style="margin-top: 50px;">What Types of&nbsp;Programs Will Receive Support From This Funding?</h2></div>
</div><div class="ptl_portlet_vertical"><div class="ptl_top_portlet" style="display:none;"></div>
<style type="text/css">
    .disabledIco {
        color: lightgrey;
    }
</style>
<div id="tabPortlet_212609" data-clientId="ctl00_ContentPlaceHolder1_ctl53" class="PO-wrapper PO-tabAccordion">
    
    
    <div id="ctl00_ContentPlaceHolder1_ctl53_upPanel">
	
            <div id="ctl00_ContentPlaceHolder1_ctl53_divTabs" role="region" style="width:100%;" class="TA-accordionMode" portlet="accordion" aria-label="Accordion Portlet">
                
            </div>
        
</div>
    
    <label for="ctl00_ContentPlaceHolder1_ctl53_divTabEdit" aria-hidden="true"  Style="display: none">tab visible</label>
    <input name="ctl00$ContentPlaceHolder1$ctl53$divTabEdit" type="text" value="True" id="ctl00_ContentPlaceHolder1_ctl53_divTabEdit" class="divTabEdit" style="display: none" />
    
</div>

<script type="text/javascript">
    
	$(document).ready(function () {
		var logConsole = function (str) {
			console.log(str);
		};
		if ($('#tabPortlet_212609 .divTabEdit').val() == "True") {
			var isModern = ('True');
			if (isModern.toLowerCase() == "true") {
				var tabObj = $('#tabPortlet_212609 ');
				var tabM = $('#ctl00_ContentPlaceHolder1_ctl53_divTabs').attr('portlet') == 'tab';

				function activate() {
					$(tabObj).scrollingTabs({
						tabs: [{"paneId":"ctl00_ContentPlaceHolder1_ctl53_divTabs_0","title":"Early Childhood Education","content":"<p>Expands pre-K options to promote early learning outcomes including social, emotional and behavioral development and providing crucial early literacy, numerical and mathematical skills. </p>","active":false,"disabled":false},{"paneId":"ctl00_ContentPlaceHolder1_ctl53_divTabs_1","title":"Fine and Performing Arts","content":"<ul>\n    <li><strong>Grade Level Arts Enrichment Events/Activities - </strong>Identify and fund age and developmentally appropriate field trips for elementary and middle school. At a minimum, these activities will target students grades K, 1, 3, 5, 6, and 8.</li>\n    <li><strong>Expanded Arts Access for K-5 -&nbsp;</strong>Develop a four-year cycle to ensure that all schools receive funding for music, theater, and dance equipment, uniforms, and materials that support performing arts programs.</li>\n    <li><strong>Stage, Sound, and Lighting  Enhancements -</strong> Develop a four-year cycle to address any stage, sound, and lighting needs at all schools that prioritizes schools based on the results of the district wide deferred maintenance plan.</li>\n</ul>","active":false,"disabled":false},{"paneId":"ctl00_ContentPlaceHolder1_ctl53_divTabs_2","title":"School Safety & Security","content":"<p><strong>Behavioral Threat Assessment &amp; Mental Health Support</strong></p>\n<ul>\n    <li>Fund additional threat assessment staff with training in early identification and response to potential threats.</li>\n    <li>Expand access to school-based counselors, psychologists and social workers.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Facility Hardening &amp; Safety Upgrades</strong></p>\n<ul>\n    <li>Install impact-resistant windows and doors in high-risk areas.</li>\n    <li>Upgrade locking mechanisms on doors.</li>\n    <li>Improve exterior fencing and gate controls for all campuses.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Surveillance Camera Systems</strong></p>\n<ul>\n    <li>Upgrade cameras with high-resolution, cloud-based systems.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Emergency Communication Systems</strong></p>\n<ul>\n    <li>Update district-wide two-way radio systems and other essential communication supports.&nbsp;</li>\n    <li>Expand emergency alert stations throughout campus.<br>\n    <strong><br>\n    </strong></li>\n</ul>","active":false,"disabled":false},{"paneId":"ctl00_ContentPlaceHolder1_ctl53_divTabs_3","title":"Workforce Development/Career Technical Education  (CTE)","content":"<ul>\n    <li><strong>Career Pathway Expansion -</strong>&nbsp;Expand/update career academies in healthcare, construction, cybersecurity, and culinary arts with labs and tools. Purpose: Aligned programs with local workforce needs and college articulation agreements.</li>\n    <br>\n    <li><strong>Mobile Workforce Training Labs -</strong> Create mobile CTE units (e.g., trailers outfitted with a&nbsp; welding, coding, or manufacturing simulators) that travel to middle schools to promote options within PCPS.</li>\n    <br>\n    <li><strong>Paid Internships and Job Coaching - </strong>Fund student internship stipends, job site transportation, and part-time job coaches for students in CTE/Workforce tracks.</li>\n    <br>\n    <li><strong>Equipment and Facilities -</strong> Use funds allocated to address school level needs and equipment replacement to ensure that students and staff have access to current industry standard aligned resources.</li>\n</ul>","active":false,"disabled":false}],// required,
						propPaneId: 'paneId', // optional - pass in default value for demo purposes
						propTitle: 'title', // optional - pass in default value for demo purposes
						propActive: 'active', // optional - pass in default value for demo purposes
						propDisabled: 'disabled', // optional - pass in default value for demo purposes
						propContent: 'content', // optional - pass in default value for demo purposes
						tabMode: tabM,
						scrollToTabEdge: false, // optional - pass in default value for demo purposes
						disableScrollArrowsOnFullyScrolled: false // optional- pass in default value for demo purposes
					}).on('ready.scrtabs', function () {
						$('#' + this.id + ' .tab-pane').attr('tabindex', 0);
					});
				};

				activate();

            }
        }
	});

